When doing real work in a repo: check `.orchestrator-lock.json`. If missing, offer `Orchestrator init` — never download or run init alone from chat. If `enabled` is false, do not insist. If lock OK, load `.agents/skills/orchestrator/SKILL.md`. For updates, narrate only and ask the user to run `update --apply`.
